				<wikidot:authorName>Gaffsey</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>6590029</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I feel like &quot;one of the Black Queens is involved with the thing/gets psychically splattered&quot; has been done better in other entries. This was competent enough, and represented an intersection of a few of my interests, so it gets a neutral vote.</p> <p>Low-key bummed that there aren't any futurist/dada theater versions of the Tragedy. A mass murder/suicide/riot backed by a chorus of <em>intonarumori</em> would be, if not good, at least pretty distinctive.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
